OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after shooting in
OL,4,ADigbeth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with a firearms
OL,7,Foffence after a man was shot near an
OL,8,Fevents venue in Birmingham.
OL,10,FRowan Youngsam, aged 20, is accused of
OL,11,Fpossession of a firearm with intent to
OL,12,Fendanger life, and wounding with
OL,13,Fintent.
OL,15,FYoungsam has been remanded in custody
OL,16,Fto appear before Birmingham magistrates
OL,17,Fon Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
